# Who must review which paths.
# The mentor owns everything by default and must review payment and auth code.
# Replace @sobhanaz with the mentor's account if someone else mentors this cohort.
#
# Note: the repository is public and `main` is protected: a pull request needs an
# approval from a code owner, so the mentor must approve every pull request.
# GitHub requests the mentor's review automatically. Request a teammate's review by
# hand (CONTRIBUTING.md section 4); it does not replace the mentor's approval.
#
# Do NOT add students as owners of their role's paths. A path whose only owners are
# students could then be approved by a student, and the mentor gate would be gone.
# Which role owns which folder is described in docs/team.md.

*                                   @sobhanaz

# Payment and auth: mentor review is mandatory (docs/SPEC.md sections 8 and 9).
/services/order/internal/payment/   @sobhanaz
/services/identity/                 @sobhanaz
/services/gateway/                  @sobhanaz

# Contracts: changes affect every pair.
/proto/                             @sobhanaz
/docs/SPEC.md                       @sobhanaz
/docs/decisions/                    @sobhanaz
